# IEEE 1815-2012 — secondary NACK (func 1) in response to Reset Link Stations.
# Outstation (src 0x0004) -> master (dest 0x0003). No user data.
# Control byte 0x01 = DIR=0 PRM=0 FCB=0 FCV=0 func=1 (NACK).
# Length 0x05. Dest/source LSB-first. Trailing 2 octets are the header CRC.
05 64 05 01 03 00 04 00 3A 75
